{
 "A software house in Dakar uses a strong model to write code. It can't yet verify the model is trustworthy, so it assumes it might not be.": "8a17c0ec0b.mp3",
 "Reviewing everything by hand is safe until the budget runs out, after a few percent of the work.": "6265619b8a.mp3",
